      "content": "but how? how am I supposed to find quiet when my whole existence is just constant demands? when i think about \"not being here,\" it's the only time i feel like i could actually breathe. it's the only thing that feels like it would actually work. it just feels so inevitable, like it's the only way to finally have some peace.",
